+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enforced on all builds, including development builds: a prior workaround that disabled certificate verification in development builds has been removed, so development, test, and production builds now undergo the same verification rigor, prioritizing consistent security posture over development convenience.
